Project_JUKE Privacy Policy
Effective Date: September 20, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how OgDevelopment ("OgDevelopment," "we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, stores, and shares information when you use Project_JUKE (the "Game"), including its online services, multiplayer features, websites, and related services.

By using Project_JUKE, you acknowledge the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

1. Information We Collect
Depending on how you use Project_JUKE, we may collect or receive the following types of information.

Account and Player Information
We may collect information associated with your Game account, including:

Player or account identifiers
Display names and usernames
Game progress and statistics
Inventory, unlocks, achievements, and other game-related information
Game settings and preferences
Matchmaking and multiplayer information
Friends or player relationships, where applicable
Information associated with purchases and purchased entitlements
Project_JUKE may use Microsoft PlayFab and Unity Gaming Services to provide account, backend, multiplayer, matchmaking, cloud-storage, and other online functionality.

Meta Quest Information
When you use Project_JUKE on a Meta Quest device, the Game may receive information made available through Meta's platform and software development tools that is necessary to operate the Game and provide its features.

Depending on the features you use, this may include:

Meta platform or account identifiers
Device information
Operating-system information
Application information
Network and connectivity information
Information necessary for multiplayer functionality
Technical and performance information
Project_JUKE does not intentionally collect or store camera images, eye-tracking information, facial-expression information, or other biometric information unless a future feature specifically requires such collection and this Privacy Policy is updated accordingly.

Voice and Text Communications
Project_JUKE may provide voice and text communication features.

When you use these features, information necessary to transmit communications to other players may be processed.

This may include:

Voice communication data required for real-time voice communication
Text messages
Player identifiers
Communication and session information
Voice communications are intended to facilitate real-time communication between players. We do not intentionally store voice conversations as permanent recordings unless a specific feature expressly provides for recording or storage.

User-Generated Content
Project_JUKE may allow players to create, select, upload, use, or share user-generated content, including:

Usernames and display names
Custom skins and cosmetic content
Player-created modifications
Other content submitted through Game features
Content that you make available to other players may be visible to those players and may be associated with your username or player identifier.

You should not submit personal information that you do not want other players to see.

Device and Technical Information
We and our service providers may automatically collect technical information necessary to operate, secure, troubleshoot, and improve Project_JUKE.

This may include:

Device type and model
Operating-system version
Game version
Application identifiers
Device or installation identifiers
IP address and other network information
Approximate location information derived from network information
Connection information
Game-session information
Performance information
Error and crash information
Diagnostic information
Hardware and software configuration information
Analytics
We may use analytics services to understand how players use Project_JUKE and to improve the Game.

Analytics information may include:

Game sessions
Features used
Gameplay events
Performance information
Device information
Error information
General usage patterns
Project_JUKE may use Unity Analytics and other analytics services integrated into the Game.

Crash Reporting and Diagnostics
Project_JUKE may collect crash reports and diagnostic information when the Game encounters an error or crashes.

This information may include technical information about your device, Game version, operating system, error conditions, and other information necessary to diagnose and resolve technical problems.

Purchases
If Project_JUKE offers purchases, payments may be processed through the applicable platform or payment provider.

We may receive information necessary to verify purchases and provide purchased products, virtual items, subscriptions, or other entitlements.

We do not intentionally collect or store your full payment-card number.

